# @sploot/common

- `packages/common/src/` owns upload limits, MIME validation (`UPLOAD`,
  `isValidMimeType`), and shared API response types such as
  `SplootApiUploadResponse`.
- Add shared code there, export it from `packages/common/src/index.ts`, and
  import it via `@sploot/common`. The Go generator and TypeScript clients consume
  this contract.
- A changed constant or type is a contract change: update affected consumers and
  keep `docs/API.md` synchronized when routes change.
- The extension resolves the package through its WXT alias; MCP uses the
  workspace package and Go generates bounds/types. Preserve those boundaries.
